{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012PrwBPKaDi8rQZ9adErajt","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# agent_progress_probe — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 18:32 UTC | 更新原因: Loop #4 更新: 4 个实验新完成(oh-full-finetune/oh-cmdrep-ablation/data-scaling-v2/ablation-window-size), 任务清单更新, 进入写作窗口\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nProgressProbe: 轻量 GRU probe + **结构特征** 检测 LLM agent progress stagnation。**D039 Pivot**: TLM 全面失败，论文转向 **empirical analysis paper**——三层贡献：(1) Structural signal discovery（主贡献）；(2) LF temporal dynamics + cross-agent analysis（方法论）；(3) TLM negative finding。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🔬 **Research** — 实验主体完成，进入收尾 + 写作窗口。距 5/25 DDL **11 天**。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 ARR 5/25 cycle** — 定位 empirical analysis / Findings\\\\n\\\\n## 实验完成度\\\\n41 实验 / 34 DONE (27 success, 7 negative) / 0 RUNNING / 7 PREPARING\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 覆盖\\\\n| Claim | 状态 | 关键结论 |\\\\n|-------|------|---------|\\\\n| **C1 Structural signal** (primary) | ✅ 充分 | Struct GB: 0.9951 in-domain, 0.967 cross-agent; +24.3pp vs LLM judge; 3 encoder 均 >0.90; k=5 最优 0.9309 |\\\\n| **C2 LF temporal dynamics** | ✅ 充分 | cmd_rep leading -1.87步; OB lagging +6.7步; **OH cmd_rep 角色反转** → 去 cmd_rep 后 F1 0.7512→0.9272 (+21.6pp) |\\\\n| **C3 TLM negative** | ✅ 充分 | TWV 劣化下游 -4.9~-21.7pp; HMM overpredict stag; lag-HMM 仅追平 MV |\\\\n| **Cross-agent** | ✅ 有数据 | Struct GB 0.967 跨域; probe 需 few-shot 适配; OH cmd_rep 角色反转 |\\\\n| **Data scaling** | ✅ 完成 | data-scaling-v2: 10%→25%→50%→100% 完整曲线 |\\\\n| **Gold set** | 🔴 未启动 | 材料就绪(650 样本+标注指南)，等用户确认标注人力 |\\\\n\\\\n## 🔴 关键路径\\\\n**Gold set 人工标注是 GO/NO-GO gate**——唯一非 circular 评估。距 DDL 11 天，今天不启动标注时间极度紧张。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 🔴🔴 用户确认标注人力 → 启动 650 窗口标注\\\\n- [ ] F1_stag per-class breakdown + 0.000 溯源（分析任务，不需 GPU）\\\\n- [ ] train-without-ob conf>=2 子集对比\\\\n- [ ] 更新 paper_framing.md — D039 pivot 重排 Claims\\\\n- [ ] 写 experiment_plan.yaml（post-pivot）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate(review_mode=\\\\\\\"full\\\\\\\") — pivot 后重新模拟审稿\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 启动 Full Draft（不依赖 gold set 的章节可先写）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键路径时间线\\\\n```\\\\n5/14 NOW   ROADMAP 更新 + framing pivot + 催用户标注\\\\n5/14-15    Agent: F1_stag 分析 + conf>=2 对比 + 剩余分析任务\\\\n5/15-17    标注进行中 | 并行: Paper Agent 起草不依赖 gold set 的章节\\\\n5/17-18    标注完成 → gold set 验证实验\\\\n5/18-21    Paper Agent Full Draft + Dream 验证\\\\n5/21-24    论文迭代 + polish\\\\n5/25       提交\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- bjb2-23165: RTX 5090 32G × 2（cuda:0 + cuda:1）\\\\n- 剩余需求: ~4 GPU-hrs（gold set 验证 + 少量补充实验）\\\\n- 当前: Agent 队列深度 2，twv-no-temporal-sigma2 Worker running（低优先级，自然完成）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-14 | Baseline 数值引用规则：跨域 claim 统一用 cross-agent-structura | cross-agent-structural, structural-on-twv, non-nlp-baseline |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-14 | 写入 experiment_plan.yaml (32 experiments) + 更新 pape | oh-cmdrep-ablation, data-scaling-v2, ablation-window-size, oh-full-finetune |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-14 | D039 \\\\\\\"TLM 判死\\\\\\\" 结论暂缓：Reviewer 发现 σ=2.0 关键诊断未运行 + cro | temporal-label-model, twv-ablation, structural_on_twv |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-14 | TLM 彻底判死：structural-on-twv 证明 TWV 标签劣化下游分类器（最高 -21 | structural-on-twv, twv-ablation, temporal-label-model, cross-agent-structural |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-14 | TWV ablation negative：TLM 从 core claim 降级为 promisi | twv-ablation, temporal-label-model, oh-lf-temporal |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-14 | TWV ablation 梯度反转：temporal alignment 在 circular ev | twv-ablation, temporal-label-model, twv-sigma-sweep |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-14 | D031 确认 Scenario B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe  | cross-agent-structural, non-nlp-baseline, oh-full-finetune, cross-agent |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-14 | D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe，论文 pivo | cross-agent-structural, non-nlp-baseline, temporal-label-model |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-14 | D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe。Pivot 到 | cross-agent-structural, non-nlp-baseline, temporal-label-model |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-14 | 全面优先级重排：gold set 标注为唯一关键路径，暂停 circular eval 框架内的 a | non-nlp-baseline, human-annotation, temporal-label-model |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3696, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SXJtEoc3Xt6dNNRsKd2FPn","session_id":"e100e194-7f3c-443d-b4ce-e36ca0f83e44","uuid":"3828356a-dc54-471a-9439-bdba608e0b42","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:12:04.578Z"}
