ng cmd_rep LF from both SWE-bench and OpenHands sides improves zero-shot cross-agent transfer. Baseline 3-LF zero-shot macro_f1=0.528.\\n  [cross-agent-no-cmdrep results](/api/workspace-files/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/cross-agent-no-cmdrep/data/results_cross_agent_no_cmdrep.txt)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 28 / 负向 9 / 失败 1 / 共 39\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nbjb2-23165: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- encoder-ablation-probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- data-scaling: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B8qV6UnA5DW1MGFvUGp9VP","session_id":"e100e194-7f3c-443d-b4ce-e36ca0f83e44","uuid":"60b14b45-20d6-4e1b-8cda-8f03eb133000","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:12:04.780Z"}
