{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKn3oYAcjnUy3Ap3PGM3Ds","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — agent_progress_probe\\\\n\\\\n## 决策原因与经验教训\\\\n\\\\n### D039 Pivot: 从 method paper 转 empirical study (2026-05-14)\\\\n- D034/D035 确认 structural features 碾压 probe；D037/D038 确认 TWV ablation negative\\\\n- 论文重定位：(1) Structural Signal Discovery (primary), (2) LF Temporal Dynamics (analytical), (3) TLM Negative Finding\\\\n- Probe 降级为 pipeline demonstration 组件\\\\n- AgentPRM 第一作者是 **Xi**（席）不是 Xie（谢）\\\\n\\\\n### cmd_rep 在 OH 上失败的根因 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- 问题不是 FPR 高（仅 0.7%），而是 `all_unique → PROGRESS` 规则注入 36,901 个错误 PROGRESS 标签（precision 48.5%）\\\\n- OH stagnation 表现为\\\\\\\"广泛但无效的探索\\\\\\\"——命令文本各不相同但整体无进展\\\\n- 98.2% OH stagnation 窗口命令完全唯一，触发 `all_unique → PROGRESS`\\\\n- 对比：SWE-agent stagnation = 字面命令重复，cmd_rep 能正确捕捉\\\\n- 推荐修复：移除 `all_unique → PROGRESS` 规则改为 ABSTAIN\\\\n- **论文核心 insight for Claim 2**：LF 失败模式与 agent 行为模式的交互\\\\n\\\\n### TLM 方法选择：TWV > HMM (2026-05-14)\\\\n- TWV (Gaussian σ=3.0): conf≥2 cross-eval F1=0.9003 (+0.57pp vs MV), 14.1% conf=1 flip rate, 64% smoothness reduction\\\\n- HMM 失败：file_diff emission 主导 (P(prog|state1)=0.932)，stag 过预测 53% vs MV 28%，cross-eval F1=0.7502\\\\n- TWV 优于 FlyingSquid：FS 在 conf≥2 与 MV 100% 一致，conf=1 引入 systematic stag bias\\\\n- TWV ablation (D037/D038): 绝大多数 σ 有害，σ=2 唯一微弱正向但下游分类器全面劣化\\\\n\\\\n### Cross-agent structural: 结构特征天然跨域 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- Struct+GB on OH all: 0.9674, OH conf≥2: 0.992; Struct+RF OH conf≥2: 0.996\\\\n- 原因：结构特征从 raw action 数据计算，跨 agent 天然迁移\\\\n- Probe embedding domain shift (A-distance=1.993) 导致跨域失败\\\\n\\\\n### SupCon 消融：λ=1.0 显著提升 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- SupCon auxiliary loss λ=1.0 → macro_f1=0.9326 (+2.71pp vs baseline 0.9055)\\\\n- f1_stag 提升最大：+4.24pp（0.8593→0.9017）\\\\n\\\\n### Circular eval 全貌 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- MV=1.0, cmd_rep=0.945, structural RF=0.995 — 全部是 circular eval artifact\\\\n- probe 0.906 是 LF consensus fidelity，不是 ground-truth accuracy\\\\n- Gold set 是唯一突破 circular eval 的途径\\\\n\\\\n### OB framing = Privileged Distant Supervision (2026-05-14)\\\\n- OB 移除后 f1_stag=0.641±0.034 (3-seed)；7.1pp 是纯信号贡献\\\\n- \\\\\\\"0.000\\\\\\\" 来源已溯清：woob 模型在 OB-only 窗口子集（687w）上全预测 progress，非完整测试集结果。D025/D026 已撤回\\\\n\\\\n### Cross-agent transfer bottleneck (2026-05-14)\\\\n- cmd_rep LF 在 OH 上 71% false positive（根因：all_unique→PROGRESS 规则）\\\\n- file_diff 是唯一可靠跨 agent LF（87% 正确率）\\\\n- Few-shot 0.53→0.69→0.75 单调递增但天花板远低于 in-domain\\\\n\\\\n### Cross-eval 索引 bug (2026-05-14)\\\\n- split_info.json 索引是 conf≥2 过滤后 15401 数组的索引，不是 54809 全集\\\\n- 教训：涉及 filtered subset 的 split_info 必须记录 keep_indices\\\\n\\\\n### 服务器重命名 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- autodl-5090 已改名 bjb2-23165\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2332, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B8qV6UnA5DW1MGFvUGp9VP","session_id":"e100e194-7f3c-443d-b4ce-e36ca0f83e44","uuid":"9a83e7ff-f00d-4622-a2fa-567e5dbbf0fb","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:12:09.850Z"}
