\n    方向\\\\n  rationale: Manager 要求进行新颖性自查。搜索 2024-2026 文献发现：(1) AgentPRM (arxiv 2511.08325, ACM\\\\n    Web 2026) 是最直接竞争者，但它是 RL-based step-level reward model（需 outcome labels），我们是 WS-based\\\\n    window-level monitoring（不需人工标签）——差异足够；(2) PRM 方向 2025-2026 非常拥挤（5+ 论文），必须显式定位；(3)\\\\n    SlopCodeBench (2026) 量化了 agent degradation，强化我们的 motivation；(4) Temporal label\\\\n    model（利用 LF 时序角色做标签聚合）仍无人做过——这是最强新颖性锚点。建议：Related Work 加 PRM 专门小节，Introduction\\\\n    引用 SlopCodeBench 数据，framing 强化方法论贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: novelty anchor\\\\n    result: planned, still novel in 2026\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 重构 Claim 2 表述：F1=LF consensus fidelity（非 ground-truth accuracy），elevate\\\\n    跨域迁移为 non-circular evidence\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 circular evaluation 方案后判定：(1) 当前 claim \\\\\\\"detects stagnation\\\\n    with F1=0.906\\\\\\\" 无法防御——ground truth 缺失；(2) conf=1 评估仍然 circular（单 LF 标签）；(3) 论文需明确\\\\n    F1 度量 LF consensus fidelity 而非 ground-truth detection accuracy；(4) 三条非 circular\\\\n    价值线（实时性/成本/跨域迁移）应作为核心 selling point；(5) cmd_rep 0.945 vs 0.746 gap 应主动展示以量化 circularity。Cross-domain\\\\n    (OH) 结果是唯一 non-circular 评估——OH 标签独立于 SWE 训练标签。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 on conf≥2, circular artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: OH zero-shot 0.532, LF Oracle 0.96 — non-circular\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: 100% OH data 0.751, LF reliability ceiling confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-llm-judge\\\\n    role: planned comparison\\\\n    result: LLM judge as partial external validation\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Circular eval framing pivot: reframe claims as LF consensus fidelity,\\\\n    structural baseline 0.995 as circularity evidence, human gold set as credibility\\\\n    lifeline'\\\\n  rationale: 'Three converging signals: (1) cmd_rep single LF 0.945 > probe 0.906\\\\n    on conf≥2 (circular); (2) structural features 0.995 on conf≥2 (reverse-engineering\\\\n    LFs); (3) Reviewer warning that claim restructuring is P0. All quantitative results\\\\n    on LF-derived labels are fundamentally circular. Non-circular evidence: cross-domain\\\\n    transfer (OH labels independent), real-time value (OB lags +6.7 steps), cost efficiency\\\\n    (vs LLM judge). Human gold set is the only path to credible stagnation detection\\\\n    claims.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 circular artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: structural features 0.995 reverse-engineering LFs\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: support\\\\n    result: OH labels independent, non-circular evidence\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: non-nlp-baseline 0.9951 暴露 MV 标签可被结构特征完美预测，必须验证 cross-agent 场景下 structural\\\\n    vs probe 的迁移对比\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: structural features (RF) macro_f1=0.9951 >> probe\\\\n    0.9055 on in-domain conf≥2。MV 标签本质上是结构特征的确定性函数。Probe 在 MV 标签上的 in-domain 评估失去意义。唯一可能的\\\\n    probe 差异化价值：cross-agent transfer（embedding 捕获 agent-general 语义模式，而 hand-crafted\\\\n    结构特征是 agent-specific 的）。必须立即在 OH cross-agent 上跑 non-nlp baseline 验证。结果决定论文是 (a)\\\\n    probe 有跨域优势 → 重新定位为迁移鲁棒性 (b) probe 无跨域优势 → 论文需根本性重构为 weak supervision pipeline\\\\n    贡献。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951, GB 0.9951, LR 0.9874 — structural features near-perfectly predict\\\\n      MV labels\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: comparison needed\\\\n    result: probe zero-shot 0.532, need structural baseline on OH\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: compounding evidence\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906 on conf≥2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: non-nlp-baseline 0.9951 暴露 MV 标签可被结构特征近完美预测，需紧急验证 OH 跨域泛化\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: 30 个结构特征 (RF) macro_f1=0.9951 远超 probe 0.9055。MV\\\\n    标签本质上是结构特征的确定性函数——LFs 就是结构启发式的自动化，结构特征是 LFs 的超集。在 MV 标签上的任何对比都在循环中打转。关键判定点：(1)\\\\n    如果 OH 上结构特征也碾压 probe → probe 无独立价值，论文需大幅 pivot 到 pipeline 方法论贡献；(2) 如果 OH 上结构特征不\\\\n    transfer 而 probe（via fine-tune）可以 → probe 的泛化性是真实的差异化价值，论文故事成立。此实验是 paper viability\\\\n    的 gate。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 >> probe 0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: baseline-lf-oracle\\\\n    role: supporting evidence\\\\n    result: cmd_rep 0.945 > probe 0.906, circular\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: key comparison needed\\\\n    result: probe zero-shot 0.532, fine-tune 0.751\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 全面优先级重排：gold set 标注为唯一关键路径，暂停 circular eval 框架内的 ablation 实验，并行启动 TLM 实现\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 分析：(1) non-nlp 0.9951 + circular eval 双重打击下，所有在 MV\\\\n    标签上的实验对论文竞争力边际贡献极低；(2) Gold set 同时是 C1(TLM验证)、C2(打破circular)、C3(跨域ground truth)\\\\n    的根基；(3) 距 EMNLP 5/25 仅 11 天，gold set annotation(2-3天) + TLM(1-2天) + validation(0.5天)\\\\n    + paper(3-4天) = 最少 7-10 天，今天不启动就来不及；(4) ablation-window-size/lf-holdout/supcon/architecture\\\\n    全在 circular 围墙内，对竞争力无增量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: triggered reassessment\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 proves MV labels are deterministic function of structural features\\\\n  - exp_id: human-annotation\\\\n    role: critical path\\\\n    result: planned, 650 samples + guide ready, annotation not started\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: critical path\\\\n    result: 'planned, deps: lf-temporal-dynamics done, human-annotation blocked'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe。Pivot 到 TLM 为核心贡献（方案 A），probe\\\\n    降级为 pipeline 组件\\\\n  rationale: 'D031 cross-agent non-nlp baseline: Struct+GB 跨域 0.967 vs Probe full-FT\\\\n    0.751 (+21.6pp)。Probe 在 in-domain 和 cross-domain 都不如结构特征。Probe 作为核心贡献已死。方案 A（TLM\\\\n    + temporal dynamics + structural finding）是最可行路径：(1) TLM 是方法论贡献，不受 circular eval\\\\n    影响（gold set 验证）；(2) structural finding 是 genuine negative result（stagnation 信号本质是结构性的）；(3)\\\\n    LF temporal dynamics 是 novel analysis。仍投 EMNLP（TLM 对 data programming on sequential\\\\n    data 的贡献与 NLP 社区相关）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: confirmed scenario B\\\\n    result: Struct+GB 0.967, Struct+RF 0.912 vs Probe full-FT 0.751\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: in-domain evidence\\\\n    result: RF 0.9951 vs probe 0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: new core contribution\\\\n    result: implementation in progress\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe，论文 pivot 到 TLM + structural\\\\n    signal discovery（方案 A）\\\\n  rationale: D031 cross-agent non-nlp baseline 结果：Struct+GB 跨域 OH macro_f1=0.967 vs\\\\n    Probe full-FT 0.751（+21.6pp）。Probe 在任何维度（in-domain, cross-domain, 成本, 简洁性）都不优于结构特征。核心贡献必须\\\\n    pivot。方案 A（TLM + structural finding）最强：(1) TLM 是方法论贡献，temporal-aware label aggregation\\\\n    对 sequential data programming 有通用性；(2) \\\\\\\"stagnation signals are structural not\\\\n    semantic\\\\\\\" 是 genuine finding；(3) structural features 跨域有效性是 positive result（只是\\\\n    probe 的 negative）；(4) EMNLP 仍可投（TLM 方法论 + 弱监督范式）。方案 B（换 ICSE）可作 fallback 但不主动降级。方案\\\\n    C（保留 probe）最弱，reviewer 必问\\\\\\\"为什么不用结构特征\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: triggered pivot\\\\n    result: Struct+GB cross-agent 0.967 vs Probe FT 0.751\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: compounding evidence\\\\n    result: Struct+RF in-domain 0.9951 vs probe 0.9055\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: new core contribution\\\\n    result: implementing, Worker running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 确认 Scenario B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe (GB 0.967 vs probe FT\\\\n    0.751)，probe 作为核心贡献不成立，论文 pivot 到 TLM + structural signal discovery\\\\n  rationale: 'Cross-agent structural baseline: GB 0.967 zero-shot vs probe 0.751 full-finetune\\\\n    (+21.6pp)。Probe 在 in-domain (0.995 vs 0.906) 和 cross-domain 均无优势。\\\\\\\"语义停滞\\\\\\\"假说被否证——stagnation\\\\n    是结构性现象。论文需根本性重构：(1) structural finding 升级为核心贡献（\\\\\\\"stagnation signals are structural,\\\\n    not semantic\\\\\\\"是重要发现）; (2) TLM 作为方法论贡献（对 data programming 在序列数据上的扩展）; (3) probe\\\\n    降级为 pipeline 组件。Reviewer warning: OH 标签集可能与 probe 实验不一致（stag_ratio 20.87% vs 6.6%），需在同一标签集上重新评估消除\\\\n    confound。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: definitive evidence\\\\n    result: GB 0.967, RF 0.912, LR 0.780 on OH zero-shot\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: in-domain evidence\\\\n    result: RF/GB 0.9951 on SWE conf≥2\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: probe best case\\\\n    result: 0.751 with 100% OH data fine-tune\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent\\\\n    role: probe zero-shot\\\\n    result: '0.532'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: TWV ablation 梯度反转：temporal alignment 在 circular eval 上有害，σ=2.0 是孤立峰值。Claim\\\\n    1 (TLM) 降级为 conditional — 依赖 gold set 验证\\\\n  rationale: TWV ablation 结果：MV(0.8946) > no_temporal(0.8845) > full(0.8703) > no_smooth(0.6992)。梯度完全反转。σ=2.0\\\\n    是孤立高点(0.9003)，σ=1.0 和 σ=3.0 分别低 8.4pp 和 2.4pp。Registry σ 值错误(报 3.0 实为 2.0)。Temporal\\\\n    alignment 在 circular eval 上有害——但这可能因为 MV 在 circular eval 中就是 \\\\\\\"answer key\\\\\\\"，temporal\\\\n    alignment 偏离 MV 就被惩罚。Gold set 上 TWV 可能确实更准（尤其在 conf=1 区域，MV 最弱处）。保留 TWV 方法论但 Claim\\\\n    1 降级为 conditional：如果 gold set 验证成功则升级为 Core Claim，否则降级为描述性发现(LF temporal dynamics)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: triggered decision\\\\n    result: 'gradient reversed: MV > no_temporal > full > no_smooth'\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: original TLM\\\\n    result: TWV σ=2.0 +0.57pp, isolated peak\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-sigma-sweep\\\\n    role: sensitivity analysis\\\\n    result: σ=2.0 is isolated, σ-insensitive claim invalid for F1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: TWV ablation negative：TLM 从 core claim 降级为 promising direction (方案 A)，论文贡献回到\\\\n    temporal dynamics discovery + structural signal finding\\\\n  rationale: 'TWV ablation 梯度假设 TWV_full > TWV_no_temporal > MV 完全反转（at σ=3.0: MV\\\\n    0.8946 > no_temporal 0.8845 > full 0.8703）。σ=2.0 的 +0.57pp 是孤立峰值（σ=1.0 -8.4pp,\\\\n    σ=3.0 -2.4pp），且在 probe multi-seed noise range (±1.1pp) 内。Registry σ 值错报（实际 2.0\\\\n    记为 3.0）。HMM 也失败。Temporal alignment 作为方法论 claim 不成立。方案 A（降级为 promising direction）最诚实：(1)\\\\n    LF temporal dynamics discovery 是 robust 发现；(2) structural signal discovery 需 gold\\\\n    set 验证；(3) TWV 的 smoothness 改善和 qualitative properties 可作为 discussion。方案 B 守不住——Reviewer\\\\n    会用 ablation 数据直接打回。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: killed claim\\\\n    result: gradient reversed, σ=2.0 isolated peak, +0.57pp noise-level\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: original experiment\\\\n    result: registry σ mismatch (2.0 vs 3.0), conf2 F1=0.9003 only at σ=2.0\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-lf-temporal\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: 2/3 LF roles consistent cross-domain, cmd_rep reversal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: TLM 彻底判死：structural-on-twv 证明 TWV 标签劣化下游分类器（最高 -21.7pp），三种 TLM 实现全部失败。论文\\\\n    anchor 必须 pivot 到 structural signal discovery + circular eval methodology + TLM\\\\n    negative finding\\\\n  rationale: structural-on-twv 实验三条 critical 证据叠加：(1) TWV-trained 分类器在所有场景下劣于 MV-trained（in-domain\\\\n    -4.9pp, cross-agent -21.7pp, conf≥2 -1.8pp）；(2) 此前 twv-ablation 已证明 TWV 在绝大多数\\\\n    σ 下有害；(3) HMM stag overpredict + lag-aware HMM 仅追平 MV。TLM 的 downstream impact\\\\n    论点被封杀——即使 σ=2 有 +0.57pp 改进也不传递到下游。三种实现（TWV/HMM/lag-aware HMM）全军覆没。论文需要新 anchor：(a)\\\\n    structural signal discovery (0.9951/0.967) 升为 primary contribution；(b) circular\\\\n    eval methodology 作为方法论贡献；(c) TLM 作为 well-motivated negative finding。Gold set 标注仍是唯一关键路径——验证\\\\n    structural signals 不只是 circular eval artifact。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: structural-on-twv\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: 'TWV labels degrade downstream classifiers: in-domain -4.9pp, cross-agent\\\\n      -21.7pp, conf≥2 -1.8pp'\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: TWV harmful for most σ values\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: HMM stag overpredict; lag-aware HMM only ties MV 0.8936\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: alternative_anchor\\\\n    result: Structural features 0.967 cross-agent, new primary contribution candidate\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D037\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: D039 \\\\\\\"TLM 判死\\\\\\\" 结论暂缓：Reviewer 发现 σ=2.0 关键诊断未运行 + cross-domain 结果存在 label\\\\n    mismatch confound\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer WARNING 报告指出：(1) run_twv_no_temporal_s2.py 已写好但从未执行——σ=2.0 是唯一正收益点，不知是\\\\n    temporal alignment 还是 smoothing；(2) structural_on_twv 的 GB cross-domain -21.7pp\\\\n    是 train(TWV)/eval(MV) 标签不匹配的 confound，不能解读为 TWV 劣化分类器。因此之前 D039 基于不完整证据判 TLM 死亡过早。等\\\\n    σ=2.0 诊断结果再做最终判决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: pending σ=2.0 diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: σ=3.0 negative, σ=2.0 untested\\\\n  - exp_id: structural_on_twv\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: label mismatch confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 写入 experiment_plan.yaml (32 experiments) + 更新 paper_framing.md 补充 OH cmd_rep\\\\n    消融数据 + 触发 dream_simulate(full) 验证 D039 framing\\\\n  rationale: D039 pivot 后 experiment_plan.yaml 一直为空，阻塞 coverage matrix 和 dream。现已写入\\\\n    32 个实验映射 5 个 claims，coverage 75%。framing 补充了 oh-cmdrep-ablation (+21.6pp)、encoder-agnostic、window-size、data-scaling\\\\n    四个新完成实验的数据。触发 dream full review 验证新 framing 在 EMNLP 审稿下是否站得住。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: F1 0.7512→0.9272 (+21.6pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: data-scaling-v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10-100% complete curve\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation-window-size\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: k=5 optimal 0.9309\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: macro_f1=0.7512\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: Baseline 数值引用规则：跨域 claim 统一用 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)，TWV 对比统一用\\\\n    structural-on-twv (0.9698)，禁止混用；补 3-seed 结构 baseline\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 paper_results_compilation 发现 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)\\\\n    与 structural-on-twv (0.9698) 差 0.24pp，论文同时引用两个数字会被审稿人质疑。同时 structural baseline\\\\n    均为单 seed 无方差，需补 3-seed。RF/GB sklearn 模型跑秒级，成本极低。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9674'\\\\n  - exp_id: structural-on-twv\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9698'\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9951'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 34139, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B8qV6UnA5DW1MGFvUGp9VP","session_id":"e100e194-7f3c-443d-b4ce-e36ca0f83e44","uuid":"660563ac-1a07-425a-9ccf-8e344f019344","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:12:16.240Z"}
