 temporal-label-model |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-14 | D031 确认场景 B：structural features 跨域碾压 probe。Pivot 到 | cross-agent-structural, non-nlp-baseline, temporal-label-model |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-14 | 全面优先级重排：gold set 标注为唯一关键路径，暂停 circular eval 框架内的 a | non-nlp-baseline, human-annotation, temporal-label-model |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3696, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B8qV6UnA5DW1MGFvUGp9VP","session_id":"e100e194-7f3c-443d-b4ce-e36ca0f83e44","uuid":"11e77dd0-063c-4444-b919-4eaf952dee32","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:13:01.040Z"}
